# The list of vouched or denounced users for this repository.
#
# Only vouched users should contribute issues and pull requests. A denounced
# user is explicitly blocked and future interactions may be closed by
# automation.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One GitHub handle per line, without @, sorted alphabetically.
#  - Optionally specify a platform: `platform:username`, for example
#    `github:octocat`.
#  - To denounce a user, prefix with minus: `-username` or
#    `-platform:username`.
#  - Optionally add a reason after a space following the handle.
#
# Maintainers can vouch for a contributor by commenting `!vouch` on a Vouch
# Request discussion. Maintainers can remove or block contributors with
# `!unvouch`, `!denounce`, or `!denounce username`.

{{INITIAL_VOUCHED_USERS}}
